w photo，无滤镜直出，超高细节，锐利焦点，室内暖光，纪实摄影，日常市井写真。23 岁成年女性，东亚面孔，温柔平和气质，暖白皮，完全自然素颜，原生皮肤质感，五官柔和舒展，正坐在老式理发店的理发椅上，理发师正在给她剪头发，她闭着眼睛，神情放松平和，黑色长发被剪落几缕。身着基础款黑色纯棉 T 恤，围着凉布，无多余装饰，朴实日常穿搭。位于老式理发店室内，背景是复古理发镜、木质理发椅、老式吹风机、墙上的旧海报，暖黄色的顶灯，环境充满复古市井气息。光影：室内暖光 + 柔光，顶光均匀打亮画面，侧光勾勒人物面部轮廓，无调色无滤镜，暖色调，低饱和，宁静松弛的日常氛围。技术：100mm 微距镜头，正面平视，近景面部特写构图，中心构图，极浅景深背景虚化，皮肤次表面散射，极致原生皮肤纹理，轻微颗粒感，8K 超高清分辨率。\n画面底部添加手写体英文艺术字：“Work-Fisher”，字体纤细优雅，与整体氛围统一。字体要小，白色\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 5, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 38, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [342.255615234375, 88], "pos": [3162.632568359375, 1020.072021484375], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [33], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Z-Image-Fun-Lora-Distill-2-Steps-2603-ComfyUI.safetensors", 0.5000000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 32, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [277.98248291015625, 103.33518981933594], "pos": [2682.945556640625, 824.1527709960938], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [38, 39], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6,